node_modules
**/node_modules
**/.x
**/dist
**/*.tsbuildinfo
.git
# Anchored, non-recursive patterns do not match a nested file, and `.env` alone does not match
# `.env.production` — the file docker-compose.prod.yml's `env_file:` tells the operator to create.
# Both shipped inside the image until 2026-08-19. `.env.example` is the committed template.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
# An .npmrc carries a registry auth token; none is tracked here and none should be baked in.
**/.npmrc
coverage
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
